        distinct ``fields``; ``group_ratio`` options contain exactly
        non-empty mutually distinct ``group_fields``, a non-empty string
        ``value_field``, a non-empty ``allowed_values`` list and
        ``min_ratio`` as a JSON number in ``[0, 1]``.
